  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Operational summary:</strong> pick Enlarge or Reduce. Allies are affected without resisting; other creatures resist with a Constitution save. The target changes size by one category and its token is resized (restored when the spell ends), has advantage (Enlarge) or disadvantage (Reduce) on Strength checks and saves, and deals +1d4 or -1d4 damage with weapon attacks while you concentrate. An existing Enlarge/Reduce item with a single activity asks which one to apply and replaces the effect it places on its own.</p>",
